/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（谦让语）在；有；存在（指人或动物）；正在……；在……中；（接动词て形）……着；已……（表状态持续）；（接动词连用形，表轻蔑）竟敢……；居然……</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227760\">おかげで<ruby>元気<rp>(</rp><rt>げんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしております。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">谢谢你,我感觉好。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">降ろす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おろす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">放下；取下；降下；放低（手、旗、卷帘门等）；抛下（锚）；放下（帷幕）；披散（头发）；使（船）下水；让（乘客）下车；卸下（货物）；卸货；卸载；提取（金钱）；初次使用；初次穿戴；切下；把（鱼）去骨切片；擦碎（萝卜等）；修剪（树枝）；罢免；撤职；除名；清理（桌子）；撤下（祭品）；传下（如旧衣服）；打下（寄生虫等）；排出体外；堕胎；使流产；召唤（神灵）；招来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230827\">あの<ruby>信号<rp>(</rp><rt>しんごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>手前<rp>(</rp><rt>てまえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>降<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ろしてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">请把这个信号放在手前。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">恩</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">恩惠；恩情；人情债；恩义；恩德；仁慈；善意</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226934\">お<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>恩<rp>(</rp><rt>おん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>仇<rp>(</rp><rt>あだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>返<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你以仇恨的恩典回归了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">音</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">声音；噪音；语音；音素；汉字的音读；字音</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">温暖</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おんだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">温暖；温和；暖和</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"124321\"><ruby>島<rp>(</rp><rt>しま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>天候<rp>(</rp><rt>てんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はとても<ruby>温暖<rp>(</rp><rt>おんだん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">岛上的天气非常温暖。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">温度</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おんど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">温度</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"83744\"><ruby>物質<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶっしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>温度<rp>(</rp><rt>おんど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>によって<ruby>形<rp>(</rp><rt>かたち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质因温度而改变形状。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">オーバー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><